Description: Evidence-driven web application vulnerability scanner
 ANVIL detects and safely proves 11 active vulnerability classes (SQLi, NoSQLi,
 XSS, SSRF, command injection, path traversal, SSTI, XXE, open redirect, CORS,
 CRLF) plus 5 passive audits (security headers, JWT, secrets, outdated
 components, SRI) — covering 8 of the OWASP Top 10 — with a low false-positive
 rate. It emits machine-readable reports (text, JSON, CSV) for triage and CI
 gating, and ships an MCP server so AI agents can call it as a native tool.
 The optional headless-browser XSS verification uses a system Chrome/Chromium.

